      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>It's not just \"feeling overwhelmed.\" It's like... it's everything. I'm looking after my dad and he's just getting worse every single day, and it's constant. The doctors talk about \"quality of life\" but they aren't the ones awake at 3am doing the cleaning and the lifting and the watching. I'm just... I'm so depleted. I feel like I'm disappearing. I look in the mirror and I don't even recognize the person looking back. I'm just a ghost in a house full of sickness.",
